 "readme": "Build A Doll level plan. Build the kit first (Build A Doll > Hurdles > Build Hurdle Kit Prefabs), then run Build A Doll > Levels > Import Level Plan. Sections: a chunk id, 'part' (GatePair), 'part:moving' (GatePair_Moving), 'part:single' (GateSingle, no decoy) or 'coin:A,B' (CoinGatePair; right gate first; x2 +20 -10 /2). One 'part' per outfit part, filled in order: pants (or dress), shirt, hair, shoes, socks, hat, glasses, hand item, bag. Hair and accessories always become a RingPair. Lanes: track half width is 4, so laterals go from -4 to 4. v5 rules (19 Nov 2026): every left/right part gate gets a CashBundle trail leading to the RED gate and a hurdle ('guards', used in turn) right after the GREEN gate, on its lane. Levels 1-3 are tutorials (swipe hand). Levels 1-8 are eight different outfits. After level 8, 3-4 regular levels fill a bar that unlocks a special outfit level (12 Basketball, 17 Baseball, 21 Police, 26 Nurse, 30 Tennis). No princess / Cinderella style outfits. v5 rules (19 Nov 2026): every left/right part gate gets a CashBundle trail leading to the RED gate and a hurdle ('guards', used in turn) right after the GREEN gate, on its lane. Levels 1-3 are tutorials (swipe hand). Levels 1-8 are eight different outfits. After level 8, 3-4 regular levels fill a bar that unlocks a special outfit level (12 Basketball, 17 Baseball, 21 Police, 26 Nurse, 30 Tennis). No princess / Cinderella style outfits. v5 rules (19 Nov 2026): every left/right part gate gets a CashBundle trail leading to the RED gate and a hurdle ('guards', used in turn) on the GREEN gate's lane, guardOffset (12 m; tutorials 15) after it so there's time to steer/jump/slide, with guardClearance (10 m) of free track after it. Levels 1-3 are tutorials (swipe hand). Levels 1-8 are eight different outfits. After level 8, 3-4 regular levels fill a bar that unlocks a special outfit level (12 Basketball, 17 Baseball, 21 Police, 26 Nurse, 30 Tennis). No princess / Cinderella style outfits.",
